<title>USA: CollaGenex in cancer pact with Boehringer.</title>
<headline>CollaGenex in cancer pact with Boehringer.</headline>
<dateline>NEWTOWN, Pa. 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>CollaGenex Pharmaceuticals Inc said on Tuesday it signed a cancer research agreement with Boehringer Mannheim Italia, part of Boehringer Mannheim Group.</p>
<p>Under the pact Boehringer will conduct animal studies to evaluate the potential of certain CollaGenex compounds to treat metastatic cancer. It did not list terms of the deal.</p>
<p>--New York Newsdesk, 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
